# Fence Frames Brand & Naming Law

## Approved Canon Terminology:
- **Company / Website**: Fence Frames
- **Tagline**: Frame Your Vision | Find Your Fence
- **Interactive Widget**: Fence-Folio (HOA chapter: HOA Fence-Folio)
- **Core Engineering Hub**: FenceBook
- **Folio Spine**: Cover → Community → Materials → Blueprint → Add-ons → Ledger

## Explicitly Banned / Retired:
- ❌ **Fence Foundry** (Banned)
- ❌ Do NOT replace "Fence Frames" in site nav/tagline with "Folio" (Folio is widget chrome only).
